le full-text search out of the box",[277,296,297,300],{},[280,298,299],{},"Schema evolution"," - Use versioned migration scripts to evolve your data schema safely over time",[277,302,303,306],{},[280,304,305],{},"Multi-tenancy"," - Built-in tenant isolation at the data layer with shared index support",[277,308,309,312],{},[280,310,311],{},"Named queries"," - Define custom query methods with a SQL-like syntax",[269,314,316],{"id":315},"workflow","Workflow",[265,318,319],{},"The typical workflow for working with Kinotic persistence is:",[321,322,323,332,342],"ol",{},[277,324,325,328,329],{},[280,326,327],{},"Define your entity"," - Create a TypeScript class with decorators from ",[291,330,331],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fpersistence",[277,333,334,337,338,341],{},[280,335,336],{},"Sync to server"," - Run ",[291,339,340],{},"kinotic sync"," to push your entity definitions to the Kinotic server and generate typed service classes",[277,343,344,347],{},[280,345,346],{},"Use in your app"," - Import and use the generated services to perform data operations",[269,349,351],{"id":350},"packages","Packages",[265,353,354],{},"Two packages work together to provide the persistence layer:",[274,356,357,377],{},[277,358,359,363,364,367,368,367,371,367,374,376],{},[280,360,361],{},[291,362,331],{}," - Provides entity decorators (",[291,365,366],{},"@Entity",", ",[291,369,370],{},"@AutoGeneratedId",[291,372,373],{},"@NotNull",[291,375,293],{},", etc.), entity service interfaces, and the persistence plugin",[277,378,379,384,385,388],{},[280,380,381],{},[291,382,383],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fcore"," - Provides the connection layer (",[291,386,387],{},"Kinotic.connect()","), pagination types, and core utilities shared across all Kinotic packages",{"title":390,"searchDepth":391,"depth":391,"links":392},"",2,[393,394,395],{"id":271,"depth":391,"text":272},{"id":315,"depth":391,"text":316},{"id":350,"depth":391,"text":351},"Kinotic's persistence layer provides declarative data management with automatic CRUD service generation from TypeScript entity definitions.","md",null,{},true,{"title":26,"description":396},"g8NUkMC0tuV7NialQA4y8KUJpDwirmLhankBQvKHAX8",[404,406],{"title":80,"path":81,"stem":82,"description":405,"children":-1},"Real-time data streaming between services and clients.",{"title":93,"path":94,"stem":95,"description":407,"children":-1},"How to define entities using TypeScript decorators for Kinotic's persistence layer.",1793184814805]